# Python bytecode. Compiled .pyc files embed the absolute path of the
# source they were built from, so on a developer machine they carry the
# home directory into any commit that stages them. The pre-commit content
# guard reads the staged diff as text and cannot see inside them.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# SMT GC Phase 0 measurement evidence (local only, large)
docs/smtgc-phase0-evidence/
